# Vite environment variables (prefix with VITE_ to expose to the client)
#
# Development (local backend):
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
#
# Production (Sevalla backend):
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.sevalla.app
#
# For Sevalla deployment, see SEVALLA_DEPLOYMENT.md
# This variable is baked into the build at build time.
# If you change it, you must rebuild and redeploy the frontend.